<item>
            <title>[LU-20491] Remove legacy device OBD ioctl()</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20491</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Several ioctl() for directly interacting with OBD devices are unused by Lustre userspace utilities. Generally, userspace should not interact directly with OBD devices. If a userspace program want information about an OBD device, it can look at the global device list. If it wants to mutate an OBD device, it should use well-defined APIs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
